Z||000007||Formula||10-08-2001||04:25 PM||||if you wanna really impress them with knowledge say its a multiport fuel injected, 170 cubic inch, 60 degree v6 running 14.9 lb/hr fuel injectors.<P>or something along those lines, like the bore and stroke, or compression ratio.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000008||grinthock||10-08-2001||04:52 PM||||No tell them it's a 170 Cubic Inch High Output 2.8L V-6 Engine with a cold air intake.||||reg||1
